------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The reverse-engineering scripts under `re/` reference third-party projects at
runtime (e.g. `jogolden/whoomp`) that are intentionally NOT included here; clone
them separately. See `re/README.md` and `.gitignore`.

Prior community reverse-engineering of the WHOOP BLE protocol informed the
protocol *facts* (frame layout, CRC, command/event identifiers) documented in
`protocol/whoop_protocol.json` and `FINDINGS.md`. With thanks to their authors:
  - bWanShiTong/openwhoop ......... type-47 (V24/V12) biometric decode layout
                                    and sleep/wake stillness classifier
  - jogolden/whoomp ............... firmware-extracted framing/CRC/packet types
  - bWanShiTong/reverse-engineering-whoop, christianmeurer/whoop-reader

The HRV and strain modules under `server/ingest/app/analysis/` were ported from
bWanShiTong/openwhoop's `openwhoop-algos` (Rust) and adapted; the sleep, energy,
and recovery modules are independent implementations of published methods. All
follow these references:
  - HRV ........... Task Force of ESC/NASPE (1996); neurokit2; openwhoop-algos
  - Sleep ......... Cole & Kripke (1992); te Lindert & Van Someren (2013); Walch et al. (2019);
                    openwhoop stillness classifier (sleep/wake spine)
  - Strain ........ Karvonen (1957); Edwards (1993); Banister (1991); Tanaka et al. (2001);
                    openwhoop-algos (Edwards HRR-zone TRIMP, log->0-21 mapping)
  - Energy ........ Keytel et al. (2005); Harris-Benedict / Roza & Shock (1984)

